    "summary": "Composite quiver (a) made of wood covered with leather and snakeskin, stained black- brown with cap of plaited grass. 35 poisoned composite arrows consisting of: 32 arrows (b, f-aj) with notched reed shafts; tanged and barded iron heads bound with gut. One arrow (c) with shaft made of reed, bound with raffia; tanged and barbed iron head. One arrow-head (d), barbed, made of iron, bound with gut; inserted into broken off cane foreshaft. One arrow-head (e), barbed, made of iron, bound with cane; inserted into broken off cane shaft.",
